 island  with his sidekick diddy kong it was  funny to see that Donkey Kong wasn't too  smart but he was still the strongest  gorilla thanks to his diet of bananas  together the two friends tried to  protect the crystal coconut as king K  rool was always trying to steal it the  biggest challenge he had to face was  trying not to be distracted by the  luscious candy Kong nothing was to be  taken too seriously but we loved that it  reminded us of one of our favourite  video games there is also a lot of  catchy songs that were stuck in our  heads the show was a big hit in Japan  and it only aired briefly in the United  States The Legend of Zelda this fantasy  action-adventure video game series was  first published in 1986 but you can now  find almost 20 games on Nintendo's major  game consoles linked the hero of the  story was often given the task of  rescuing Princess Zelda and saving her  Kingdom players had the chance to  explore his fantastic universe self  puzzles and fight  if they wanted to discover even more  things they could also watch the cartoon  based on the video game The Legend of  Zelda was a 13 episode animated TV  series that aired in 1989 it was aired  on Friday instead of the Super Mario  Bros TV series that aired during the  rest of the week  Lincoln Princess Zelda were trying to  protect the Triforce of wisdom from  falling into the hands of Ganon we loved  getting to know the princess as we  rarely saw her in the original video  game but unfortunately link was not a  gentleman anymore the hero who used to  be brave and courageous was turned into  an annoying man who just wanted Elda to  kiss him this is part of the reasons why  the legends of Zelda lasted for only one  season so the cartoon was not a success  but things could get better there's a  rumor that Netflix might be working on a  live-action TV series based on Zelda no  one has much information about this but  we hope that link will get another  chance to be a part of a TV show it can  o